WEBVTT

00:04:58.055 --> 00:05:01.085
(Applause)

00:05:04.493 --> 00:05:05.976
(Applause ends)

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:09.261
Now, I would attempt to square
a five-digit number --

00:05:09.285 --> 00:05:10.794
and I can --

00:05:10.818 --> 00:05:13.779
but unfortunately,
most calculators cannot.

00:05:13.803 --> 00:05:15.769
(Laughter)

00:05:15.793 --> 00:05:18.597
Eight-digit capacity --
don't you hate that?

00:05:18.621 --> 00:05:21.574
So, since we've reached
the limits of our calculators --

00:05:21.598 --> 00:05:22.646
what's that?

00:05:23.256 --> 00:05:25.916
Does yours go higher?

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.137
Volunteer: I don't know.

00:05:27.161 --> 00:05:29.363
AB: Oh, yours does?

00:05:29.387 --> 00:05:32.295
Volunteer: I can probably do it.
AB: I'll talk to you later.